{"id":"453a692642e0bff9","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-parameters.md","title":"Parameters","display":"df-parameters — Parameters","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-parameters","aliases":["58-df-parameters","Parameters"],"display":"df-parameters — Parameters","depends_on":["[[58-df-model]]","[[58-df-formula]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment]]","[[58-df-zfc-inner3-definable-skolem-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-parameters"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-parameters</span><span>Parameters</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-parameters — Parameters"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"923884eb8fe4e61d\" href=\"?note=923884eb8fe4e61d\" title=\"58-df-model\">58-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment\">../batch03/58-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ee7c4e8a31dc0b92\" href=\"?note=ee7c4e8a31dc0b92\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inner3-definable-skolem-function\">58-df-zfc-inner3-definable-skolem-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}\">\\(\\mathcal{L}\\)</span> (first-order language)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> (formula code; its first variables are reserved for the displayed tuples)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>-structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"923884eb8fe4e61d\" href=\"?note=923884eb8fe4e61d\" title=\"58-df-model\">58-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq M\">\\(B\\subseteq M\\)</span> (parameter set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\omega\">\\(r\\in\\omega\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\">\\(M=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar a\\in M^r\">\\(\\bar a\\in M^r\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteTupleAssignment}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteTupleAssignment}_S\\)</span> are supplied by the dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TupleTruth}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TupleTruth}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tp}\">\\(\\operatorname{tp}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Definable}\">\\(\\operatorname{Definable}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}parameters\\text{-}tuple\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TupleTruth}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\phi,\\bar a,\\bar b)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\land\n\\bar a,\\bar b\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s\\;\\left[\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\n\\mathrm{FiniteTupleAssignment}_S(s,\\bar a^\\frown\\bar b,\\mathcal M)\\land\n\\operatorname{Sat}(\\phi,s)\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}parameters\\text{-}tuple\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TupleTruth}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\phi,\\bar a,\\bar b)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\land\n\\bar a,\\bar b\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s\\;\\left[\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\n\\mathrm{FiniteTupleAssignment}_S(s,\\bar a^\\frown\\bar b,\\mathcal M)\\land\n\\operatorname{Sat}(\\phi,s)\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}parameters\\text{-}type} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\land M=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land B\\subseteq M\\land\\bar a\\in M^r\n\\to\\operatorname{tp}^{r}_{\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L}(\\bar a/B)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\phi,\\bar b\\rangle:\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\bar b\\in B^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\n\\mathrm{TupleTruth}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\phi,\\bar a,\\bar b)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}parameters\\text{-}type} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\land M=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land B\\subseteq M\\land\\bar a\\in M^r\n\\to\\operatorname{tp}^{r}_{\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L}(\\bar a/B)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\phi,\\bar b\\rangle:\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\bar b\\in B^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\n\\mathrm{TupleTruth}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\phi,\\bar a,\\bar b)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}parameters\\text{-}empty} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\land M=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land\\bar a\\in M^r\\land\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\n\\to\\left(\\mathrm{TupleTruth}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\phi,\\bar a,\\varnothing)\n\\leftrightarrow\\langle\\phi,\\varnothing\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{tp}^{r}_{\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L}(\\bar a/\\varnothing)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}parameters\\text{-}empty} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\land M=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land\\bar a\\in M^r\\land\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\n\\to\\left(\\mathrm{TupleTruth}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\phi,\\bar a,\\varnothing)\n\\leftrightarrow\\langle\\phi,\\varnothing\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{tp}^{r}_{\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L}(\\bar a/\\varnothing)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}parameters\\text{-}definable} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{Definable}^{r}_{\\mathcal M}(X,B,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\land M=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land B\\subseteq M\\land X\\subseteq M^r\\land\n\\exists\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\exists\\bar b\\in B^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n\\left(X=\\{\\bar a\\in M^r:\\mathrm{TupleTruth}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\phi,\\bar a,\\bar b)\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}parameters\\text{-}definable} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{Definable}^{r}_{\\mathcal M}(X,B,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\land M=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land B\\subseteq M\\land X\\subseteq M^r\\land\n\\exists\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\exists\\bar b\\in B^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n\\left(X=\\{\\bar a\\in M^r:\\mathrm{TupleTruth}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\phi,\\bar a,\\bar b)\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Formulas are paired with their parameter tuples, rather than treating elements of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> as literal symbols of the original language. Tuple truth selects a typed satisfaction recursion and a canonical total assignment.</li>\n<li>Definable set: set of tuples satisfying formula with parameters from model</li>\n<li>In stability theory, stationarity is a separate property of a type, usually uniqueness of nonforking extensions; it is not part of the definition of parameters or types.</li>\n<li>Parameters vs constants: constant symbol is 0-ary parameter; parameters are arbitrary tuples</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Marker, Model Theory: An Introduction</li>\n<li>Sacks, Saturated Model Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"923884eb8fe4e61d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on"